    "question": {
      ":question/id": "138b2fa1-5696-5cfb-b4c1-4b8eecec9f34",
      ":question/problem": "At which points on the curve $4 x y + y^{2}=4 x^{2} + 8$ is the tangent vector to the curve perpendicular to the vector $j$?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked.\n\n- **I.** $(-1,-2)$\n- **II.** $(0,2)$\n- **III.** $(\\frac{1}{2},2)$\n- **IV.** $(1,0)$\n- **V.** $(1,1)$\n- **VI.** $(1,2)$",
