      ":question/id": "446c4b15-443f-5791-913e-d368494d751c",
      ":question/problem": "At which points on the curve $4 x y + 3 y^{2}=4 x^{2} + 144$ is the tangent vector to the curve perpendicular to the vector $j$?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked.\n\n- **I.** $(-3,-6)$\n- **II.** $(0,6)$\n- **III.** $(\\frac{3}{2},6)$\n- **IV.** $(3,0)$\n- **V.** $(3,3)$\n- **VI.** $(3,6)$",
