    "question": {
      ":question/id": "19395574-b7b7-53eb-80f6-a0f139a4eb1d",
      ":question/problem": "At which points on the curve $6 x y + 3 y^{2}=9 x^{2} + 36$ is the tangent vector to the curve perpendicular to the vector $j$?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked.\n\n- **I.** $(-1,-3)$\n- **II.** $(0,3)$\n- **III.** $(\\frac{1}{2},3)$\n- **IV.** $(1,0)$\n- **V.** $(1,\\frac{3}{2})$\n- **VI.** $(1,3)$",
