    "question": {
      ":question/id": "17fd84e4-36c9-5287-953e-a0957810565b",
      ":question/problem": "At which points on the curve $6 x y + y^{2}=9 x^{2} + 288$ is the tangent vector to the curve perpendicular to the vector $j$?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked.\n\n- **I.** $(-4,-12)$\n- **II.** $(0,12)$\n- **III.** $(2,12)$\n- **IV.** $(4,0)$\n- **V.** $(4,6)$\n- **VI.** $(4,12)$",
